            "paragraph": "We used 28 climate model simulations listed in Supplementary Table 1 from the CMIP6 archive. For one ensemble member of each model, annual global- and Arctic-mean SATs and monthly SIAs were calculated using variable names tas and siconc from historical, SSP1-2.6, and SSP5-8.5 experiments. The SIA was calculated from the remapped siconc on a 1\u00b0 \u00d7 1\u00ba area using the Climate Data Operators tool (https://code.mpimet.mpg.de/projects/cdo). Changes in the SAT and SIA were defined as deviations from the 1980\u20132009 mean. Along with MIROC6 (ref. 40), four climate models with a large-ensemble member (Supplementary Table 2) were used in Supplementary Figs. 16, 17, and 19.",
